# Scene 5: the rail. The sidebar's own toggle folds it to icons and opens it again
# (the toggle sits at (102, 14) open and (42, 50) in the rail; the acceptance runs'
# coordinates). Clicked within a second, so the rail's hover never opens it.
shot @MARKS@/rail.png
glide 102 14 0.5
click 102 14
wait 1.4
glide 42 50 0.3
click 42 50
wait 0.5
glide 150 720 0.4
